      "body": "Futuristic Solutions Limited approved the appointment of Mr. Navneet Singh as Chief Financial Officer & Key Managerial Personnel of the Company with effect from 9th January 2026. He is a graduate from Delhi University. He has been a Managing Director of a tourism resort located within a Wildlife Tiger Sanctuary, where he saw accounting, financial planning, and operational management. He is also a Director of Amit Buildtech Private Limited.",
